# Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) for AENS.
# Format: adr-NNN-short-title.md
# Required sections: Title, Date, Status, Context, Decision, Rationale, Consequences, Supersedes.
# Status values: proposed | accepted | rejected | superseded
# First ADR (adr-001) must acknowledge the Repository Foundation Specification as the foundational decision.
# ADRs are immutable once accepted. Superseded ADRs are not deleted — update Status only.
